<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15001" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρθμιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>united,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δ᾽ ἡμῖν ἄρθμιοι ἦσαν</span>
			<i>in league with</i> us, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.427
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.101
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἠδὲ φίλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					1312
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρθμια, τά,</span>
			<i>peaceful relations, friendship,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέως μὲν δή σφι ἦν ἄ. ἐς ἀλλήλους,
					ἐκ τούτου δὲ πόλεμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.83
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					17.23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				22.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>calm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολαὶ ὀφθαλμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					1.7.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
